OL,3,ASuspected sabotage causes major
OL,4,ANetherlands rail disruption
OL,5,
OL,6,FPipes were attached to the tracks in
OL,7,Fmultiple locations, according to local
OL,8,Fmedia. In a statement, ProRail said the
OL,9,Fincident appeared to be "an intentional
OL,10,Fdisruption... caused by human action".
OL,12,FIt added that no suspects or motives
OL,13,Fhad been identified, but the national
OL,14,Fpolice unit was investigating. The BBC
OL,15,Fhas contacted police for comment.
